## Testing

### Jest Tests (Unit & Integration)

```bash
npm test                    # Run all Jest tests with coverage
npm run test:watch        # Watch mode for development
npm run test:verbose      # Verbose output with coverage report
```

{{#hasBatsTests}}
### BATS Tests (Shell Integration Tests)

```bash
# Install BATS first (if needed)
brew install bats-core    # macOS
# or
sudo apt-get install bats  # Linux

# Run BATS integration tests
npm run test:bats         # Run integration tests
npm run test:all          # Run both Jest and BATS
```
{{/hasBatsTests}}

